---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import profilePic from '../assets/nicole pic.jpeg';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			
			<!-- Hero Section with Image -->
			<section class="hero-section">
				<div class="hero-text">
					<h2>Hello, nice to meet you!</h2>
					<p>Welcome to the official website for <strong>Nicole Donny's blog</strong>.</p>
					
					<blockquote class="quote">
						"I want an extraordinary life, so I will do <span class="pink-accent">extraordinary things</span>."
					</blockquote>
				</div>
					<Image src={profilePic} alt="Nicole Donny" class="profile-image" />
			</section>

			<!-- Intro Section -->
			<section class="intro-section">
				<p>
					I'm a computer engineering graduate from a small town in Borneo, Malaysia, with a passion for <em>creating</em> and a lifelong dream of becoming a <strong>pilot</strong>.
				</p>
				<p>
					This is my little corner of the internet. A place where I share the things I'm learning, the experiences that shape me, and the ideas that make me stop and think. I write about self-development, technology, aviation, books, fitness, and the messy process of figuring life out. 
				</p>
			</section>

			<hr class="divider" />

			<!-- Goals Section -->
			<h4 class="section-title">What I'm working toward</h4>
			<p>Right now, I'm working toward three big things:</p>
			<ul class="goals-list">
				<li><strong>✈️ Becoming a pilot</strong> — working toward my ATPL and turning a lifelong dream into a reality.</li>
				<li><strong>💻 Building and creating</strong> — growing my technical skills and building a digital portfolio that reflects what I can do.</li>
				<li><strong>🏋️ Building a fitness business</strong> — turning my passion for fitness into something that can help other people, especially beginners.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				And underneath all of that is something simpler: <em>becoming a better version of myself</em>.
			</p>
			<p>
				I've had my share of <span class="pink-accent">imposter syndrome</span>, especially as a woman in a field where I haven't always felt like I belonged. For a long time, it was easy to wonder whether I was good enough to stand beside my male peers.
			</p>
			<p>
				I'm learning to believe that I belong there—<strong>not behind them, but alongside them.</strong>
			</p>

			<hr class="divider" />

			<!-- Categories Grid -->
			<h4 class="section-title">What you'll find here</h4>
			<div class="category-grid">
				<div class="category-card">
					<h3>📖 Books & Insights</h3>
					<p>My thoughts, reflections, and lessons from the stories I read—especially the ones that stay with me long after I close the book.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="category-card">
					<h3>🌱 Self-Development</h3>
					<p>Things I'm trying, learning, and questioning as I figure out how to build a better life.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="category-card">
					<h3>💻 What I'm Learning</h3>
					<p>Technical things I've learned through engineering, projects, and building things myself.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="category-card">
					<h3>✈️ Aviation</h3>
					<p>My journey toward becoming a pilot, from the things I'm learning now to the experiences that come later.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<hr class="divider" />

			<!-- Closing Section -->
			<section class="closing-section">
				<h4 class="section-title">What I believe</h4>
				<p>
					I believe a good life is built by being kind to others and continuing to learn. I value consistency, kindness, and the audacity to dream—<span class="pink-accent">especially when the dream seems a little too big.</span>
				</p>

				<p>
					If you have a minute to spare, welcome. I hope something you find here makes you think, or simply inspires you.
				</p>
				<p class="final-callout">
					And if you disagree with me? <br />
					<span class="pink-accent">Even better. Let's talk.</span>
				</p>
			</section>

		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	/* Global main spacing */
	main {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	/* Pink Accent Color */
	.pink-accent {
		color: #d81b60;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	/* Hero Section */
	.hero-section {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.hero-text {
		flex: 1;
	}

	.hero-text h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.5px;
	}

	.profile-image {
		max-width: 220px;
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 50%;
		object-fit: cover;
		border: 4px solid #d81b60;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(216, 27, 96, 0.15);
	}

	.quote {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-style: italic;
		border-left: 4px solid #d81b60;
		padding-left: 1.2rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
		color: #4a5568; /* Adjust to a lighter gray if your blog is dark mode */
	}

	/* Typography & Structure */
	.section-title {
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		color: #d81b60;
		font-size: 1rem;
		margin-top: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.divider {
		border: 0;
		height: 1px;
		background: #e2e8f0;
		margin: 3rem 0;
	}

	/* Goals List */
	.goals-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.goals-list li {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.goals-list li::before {
		content: "•";
		color: #d81b60;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: -4px;
	}

	/* Category Grid */
	.category-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.category-card {
		background: rgba(216, 27, 96, 0.03);
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-top: 3px solid #d81b60;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease;
	}

	.category-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-3px);
	}

	.category-card h3 {
		margin-top: 0;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
	}

	.category-card p {
		margin-bottom: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	/* Closing Section */
	.closing-section {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.closing-section .section-title {
		margin-top: 0;
	}

	.final-callout {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	/* Mobile Responsiveness */
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero-section {
			flex-direction: column-reverse;
			text-align: center;
		}
		
		.quote {
			text-align: left;
		}

		.category-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>